# The build context is deliberately unused: the Dockerfile clones the
# repository at VENICE_PROXY_REF and checks out the `venice-e2ee` submodule, so
# the image does not depend on the caller's working tree.
#
# Denying everything keeps .env (a real API key), node_modules, .git,
# dist/ and build/ away from the build daemon regardless of what a future
# Dockerfile tries to COPY.
*
